  "product_info": {
    "title": "TiLECC 10.1-Inch Android Tablet PC",
    "description": "The <b>TiLECC 10.1-Inch Android Tablet (M16)</b> offers the perfect balance of power and convenience. Running on <b>Android 13</b>, it features an <b>octa-core T310 processor, 8GB RAM</b>, and <b>512GB storage</b> (expandable up to <b>1TB</b>) for seamless multitasking and large file storage. The 10.1-inch IPS display delivers crisp visuals, while the <b>10000mAh battery</b> provides up to 8 hours of streaming. <br><br> With <b>dual cameras (5MP front, 8MP rear), dual speakers</b>, and <b>Bluetooth 5.0</b>, it’s ideal for video calls, learning, or streaming content. The tablet also comes with a <b>wireless keyboard, mouse, case, charger, and OTG adapter</b>, making it a true 2-in-1 productivity device. Enjoy added features like <b>Google Family Link parental controls, FM radio</b>, and <b>dual-band Wi-Fi</b> for reliable connectivity. <br><br> Whether you’re studying, working remotely, or relaxing with your favorite shows, this tablet adapts to your lifestyle effortlessly.",
